### Block 9 — Engineering Deployment

**H2:** Run the proxy in sixty seconds

**Body:**
Packaged with Docker Compose. One command brings up the reverse proxy and the PostgreSQL state container. Development credentials only — do not publish the stack directly to the Internet.

```
# Clone and build the proxy service
$ git clone https://github.com/anasalsawy/dual-lobe-proxy.git
$ cd dual-lobe-proxy
$ cp .env.example .env         # then set DUAL_LOBE_BOOTSTRAP_KEY (>= 24 random chars)
$ docker compose up --build -d

[+] Running 2/2
 Container dual-lobe-postgres  Started
 Container dual-lobe-proxy     Started  (listening on http://localhost:8801)
```

**Health checks:**
```
$ curl http://localhost:8801/healthz   # process liveness
$ curl http://localhost:8801/readyz    # database + enabled Executor registry entry
```
> `/readyz` does not test provider credentials, Strategist worker liveness, or end-to-end model availability. Inspect state timestamps and worker logs for the Strategist.

**Routing control headers table:**

| Header | Example / values | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `X-DL-Run-ID` | `run_550e8400` | Deterministic run session; query review state with `GET /v1/dual-lobe/state/{run_id}`. Without it, every request is a new run and the Strategist cannot help later calls. |
| `X-DL-Memory-ID` | `project-billing` (default `main`) | Persistent context key; reloads verified task context into eligible turns automatically. |
| `X-DL-Floor-ID` | `shared-swarm-room` | Enables multi-agent recipient routing; suppresses responses not intended for Model A. A floor change prevents reuse of an old floor's note. |
| `X-DL-Attempt` | `1, 2, 3` | Retry counter for resilient task loops and verification back-offs. |
| `X-DL-Worker-ID` | `worker_agent_04` | Identifies the calling worker in distributed swarm pools. |
| `X-Dual-Lobe-Mode` | `bypass` | Passes the prompt straight to the upstream provider without observation/injection. A caller preference, not a security permission. |
| `X-DL-Agent-Role` | `analyst`, `auditor`, `lobe-b`, `b` | Analyst/auditor/analyst-style calls get neither Strategist injection nor new Strategist jobs. |

